c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.2136em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7998em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是预算的影子价格。实践中不会真的求解这个方程，而是按<strong>响应弹性分组</strong>做近似：把司机按&quot;对激励的敏感度&quot;分成 3–5 组，给敏感组发小额、给不敏感组发大额或不发。分组的依据是历史数据——同一司机在历史激励活动中&quot;收到通知后是否上线&quot;的统计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"激励不能只发给新人\">激励不能只发给新人</h3><p>一个常见的错误是把激励预算集中投给新司机（拉新指标好看）。后果是收入预期被扭曲：新司机的时薪预期被激励抬高，激励一停就流失，而老司机因为从未拿到激励而形成了&quot;高峰不跑&quot;的习惯。正确的分配应保证<strong>老司机的基准时段收入稳定</strong>，激励只作为高峰的额外补偿，而不是他们收入的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与用户公平\">合规与用户公平</h2><h3 id=\"监管对溢价的约束\">监管对溢价的约束</h3><p>溢价定价在多个市场受到监管关注，尤其是面向消费者的加价披露。欧盟的《平台工作指令》虽然主要针对工作条件，但它对自动化决策的透明要求同样影响定价算法——司机作为平台工作者，有权获得关于&quot;影响其作业分配与收入的自动化监测与决策系统&quot;的清晰信息（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=OJ:L_202402831\">Directive (EU) 2024/2831</a>）。这意味着溢价规则不能是黑箱：司机侧需要能看到&quot;哪些时段与区域有溢价&quot;的可解释规则，而不只是一个实时变化的数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用户侧的价格透明度\">用户侧的价格透明度</h3><p>用户侧的核心约束有两条：<strong>加价明细可展开</strong>（让用户看到&quot;基础费 + 高峰加价&quot;的构成），以及<strong>加价上限</strong>（<code>cap_multiplier</code>）。第二条不仅是口碑考虑，某些市场已经有针对极端场景（自然灾害、紧急物资）的价格管制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动态定价的数学内核是出清价格：溢价倍数应是缺口比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的次线性递增函数，并受上限约束。</li>\n<li>溢价、高峰激励、冲单奖三者的时间特性不同（即时 / 提前发布 / 事后兑现），应组合使用，而不是择一。</li>\n<li>溢价必须做邻域平滑与时间衰减，否则会产生格子边界的价格台阶与&quot;溢价归零即下线&quot;的震荡。</li>\n<li>设置最小触发单量（如 8 单）防止小样本格子误触发；订阅会员与医疗配送等例外必须在计算时排除。</li>\n<li>激励预算是边际收益递减下的分配问题，应按响应弹性分组近似；预算不能只投新人，否则会扭曲老司机的收入预期并形成&quot;高峰不跑&quot;的习惯。</li>\n<li>溢价规则需对司机与用户双向透明：司机侧需可解释的规则而非黑箱数字，用户侧需加价明细与上限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态定价与高峰激励","id":"动态定价与高峰激励"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用价格平衡供需","id":"核心概念-用价格平衡供需"},{"level":3,"text":"供需缺口与价格的关系","id":"供需缺口与价格的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"溢价与激励的分工","id":"溢价与激励的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"溢价的工程实现","id":"溢价的工程实现"},{"level":3,"text":"分格计费与平滑","id":"分格计费与平滑"},{"level":3,"text":"溢价的配置骨架","id":"溢价的配置骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"激励预算的分配","id":"激励预算的分配"},{"level":3,"text":"边际收益递减与预算分配","id":"边际收益递减与预算分配"},{"level":3,"text":"激励不能只发给新人","id":"激励不能只发给新人"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与用户公平","id":"合规与用户公平"},{"level":3,"text":"监管对溢价的约束","id":"监管对溢价的约束"},{"level":3,"text":"用户侧的价格透明度","id":"用户侧的价格透明度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"顺路派送与订单聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/real-time-dispatch-bid/along-route-batching"},"next":{"title":"峰谷弹性运力补充","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/peak-valley-crowd-supplement"}}